.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH verify 1  "verify " 
.SH NAME
verify \- Re\-check local folder blob integrity
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBverify\fR [\fB\-\-hash\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR] [\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR] [\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR] [\fB\-e\fR|\fB\-\-ext\fR] [\fB\-\-size\fR] [\fB\-\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-modified\-within\fR] [\fB\-\-modified\-before\fR] [\fB\-\-time\-modified\fR] [\fB\-\-fix\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-providers\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-sharing\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Re\-check local folder blob integrity
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-hash\fR \fI<HASH>\fR
Content hash(es) to select (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-prefix\fR \fI<PATH_PREFIX>\fR
Only entries whose path starts with this prefix
.TP
\fB\-\-path\-glob\fR \fI<PATH_GLOB>\fR
Only entries whose path matches this glob pattern
.TP
\fB\-\-remote\-only\fR
Show only entries not yet downloaded (State == remote)
.TP
\fB\-e\fR, \fB\-\-ext\fR \fI<EXT>\fR
File extensions to include (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-size\fR \fI<SIZE>\fR
Size constraints: N, \-N, +N, N%10, +5GB, etc. (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-depth\fR \fI<DEPTH>\fR
Depth constraints: N, +N (min), \-N (max) (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-depth\fR \fI<MIN_DEPTH>\fR
Alternative min depth notation
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-depth\fR \fI<MAX_DEPTH>\fR
Alternative max depth notation
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<FILE_TYPE>\fR
Filter by type: f=file, d=dir, l=symlink
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
f
.IP \(bu 2
d
.IP \(bu 2
l
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-modified\-within\fR \fI<MODIFIED_WITHIN>\fR
Newer than: \*(Aq3 days\*(Aq, \*(Aq2 weeks\*(Aq (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-modified\-before\fR \fI<MODIFIED_BEFORE>\fR
Older than: \*(Aq3 years\*(Aq, \*(Aq1 month\*(Aq (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-time\-modified\fR \fI<TIME_MODIFIED>\fR
Time modified: \*(Aq\-3 days\*(Aq (newer), \*(Aq+3 days\*(Aq (older) (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-fix\fR
Attempt to repair corrupted blobs by re\-downloading from peers
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR
Blob ticket(s) for providers (can repeat)
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-providers\fR \fI<MIN_PROVIDERS>\fR [default: 2]
Minimum providers for healthy replication
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-sharing\fR
Do not share or seed downloaded content
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]

